# sgo.build — the phone spike's Sgola side (plan 0023 M1).
#
# APP mode, even though what we want is a Go LIBRARY: `mode library` is the
# @goexport publish shape, which emits a runtime-free package and so cannot
# carry a core-dependent in-link library like wataclient. So this module
# declares an (empty) `object Main`, is built as an app, and tools/phone-spike
# /aslib.py rewrites the emitted `package main` into an importable package.
# See REPORT.md and sgola ticket NO-LIB-EMIT-FOR-RUNTIME-LIBS.
mode app
emitname watacore
binname watabind
gomod github.com/adriaanm/wata/tools/phone-spike/watacore
